  "body": "Release 0.12.0 (minor; breaking first while the major is 0).\n\n- Merged in this cut: #65 (fix #62, P0 lathe spindle), #57 (feat #9, rotary Adaptive), #60 (feat #19, lathe field sim); also on main since v0.11.0: #50 (Heidenhain block form, breaking), #58 (project/operation workflow, v50 project files, breaking - by linuxguy123), #68 (Windows snapshot goldens).\n- This branch: RELEASE_NOTES.md, CHANGELOG.md rows (one per merged behaviour PR + #50's Unreleased row -> 0.12.0), the version bump (Cargo.toml / Cargo.lock).\n- Release gate (scripts/release.ps1, all debug suites, ui, clippy -D warnings, release --ignored heavy lanes for motion/sim/app): green. Zip built locally; no installer (ISCC not installed). Not tagged - main is tagged after this merges.\n\nChangelog: none (release mechanics)",
